OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,11,     Gperformances from the UK and
OL,12,     Gbeyond including a live concert
OL,13,     Gbroadcast from Media City UK in
OL,14,     GSalford by the BBC Philharmonic
OL,15,     GOrchestra.
OL,16,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,17,     GFrom St Michael's Church, Barnes,
OL,18,     GLondon, with the choir of Tiffin
OL,19,     GSchool and music by Oliver Tarney
OL,20,     Gand Howells.
