OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,6,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,7,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,8,     GToday, antagonising censors, two
OL,9,     Gtragic losses and the writing of
OL,10,     Ghis most iconic scene.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GThe Elmore Quartet and Vista
OL,13,     GQuartet perform live ahead of
OL,14,     Gtheir performance at the
OL,15,     GGuildhall Chamber Festival. Also,
OL,16,     GMichael Waldron talks to Katie
OL,17,     GDerham about Britten and Oldham.
OL,18,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,19,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,20,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
